    "text": "Optional dependancies\nBy default no simulator is installed alongside MAMMA MIA, this is to simplify the install process as for example the glidersim requires an C++ compiler to install all of its dependencies, and this is an additional complication that may not be required e.g. if the user doesn’t want to simulate a glider. To install MAMMA MIA with the glidersim:\n$ pip install '.[glidersim]'\nAs other simulators become available they will be added here, e.g. parcels for argo float simulation.\nTo install all simulators (currently just glidersim) then:\n$ pip install '.[all]'",
