    "title": "Configuring MAMMA MIA",
    "section": "Converting Parameters",
    "text": "Converting Parameters\nSome parameters can be converted from one to the other, this often requires other parameters to be present, e.g. temperature conversion also requires depths and salinity. The currently supported conversions are:\n\npotential temperature to insitu temperature\nconservative temperature to insitu temperature\nabsolute salinity to practical salinity\ndepth to pressure",
